          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi akwitŋi mwaluwiluwu, nimwaluwili ankakulula jawu, nimwamotokeluwu ami, nimwanendeluwu nakudikaŋaa nanami, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nimunendelami nawa nakudikaŋa nawena, mwaka niyishikijaŋa nimwituna dawayilumbu jawu; neyi nyichima yawu yawudima yakadizoza, hiyakovwahila kubabesha kwanamonuwu nakuluwa kwawu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ami nami nakaanuka chitiyaŋenu chami chinatiyaŋeni naYakoba, nichitiyaŋenu chami chinatiyaŋeni naIsaka, nichitiyaŋenu chami chinatiyaŋeni naAbarahama nakaanuka; hinaka anukaniituŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ituŋa chidakashala kanka wadu dakatiya kuwaha nasabata jadu, chidakekala kwamahembi hohu wena mwosi; akovwahila kubabesha kwakamona wunakuluwa kwawu nanochu chalekeluwu mwaya wuŋaji wami, chatiyiluwu yidika yami kumuchima bwi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hela chochu, hela adi dehi mwituŋa dawayilumbu jawu, hinakayumbaku, hinakayitiya kumuchima bwi niyijilumuni to-o, nahi chitiyaŋenu chami chinatiyaŋeni nawuku; muloŋa yami Yehova Nzambi yawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naka anukila hanyijimba yawu chitiyaŋenu chawankakulula jawu, inafumishili mwituŋa daEjipitu, nyuza yenda yimona, kulonda niikali Nzambi yawu; yami Yehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.45"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
